update / Update [stack, tool] / yes → o3s update stack registry.example.com/features/tool --yes
update / Update [cli, tool] / yes → o3s update cli registry.example.com/features/tool --yes [restart]
update / Update [cli, stack] / yes → o3s update cli stack --yes [restart]
update / Update [] → (Everything is up to date.)

# vm-unfinished, 3 paths
cage / Finish making the VM → o3s init --yes
cage / Remove / yes → o3s cage rm --yes
cage / Remove / no → (Nothing changed.)

# vm-stopped, 3 paths
cage / Start → o3s cage start
cage / Remove / yes → o3s cage rm --yes
cage / Remove / no → (Nothing changed.)

# vm-running, 4 paths
cage / Open a shell in the VM → o3s cage shell --vm [terminal]
cage / Stop → o3s cage stop
cage / Remove / yes → o3s cage rm --yes
cage / Remove / no → (Nothing changed.)

